  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is only a rank three Gu. When activated it creates formless qi of strength. Beast phantoms leave the user’s body, attach to that qi, and gain the ability to attack directly. When the qi vanishes, the phantoms lose their host, dissipate, and return to the user’s body. That long range method is what present age strength path Gu Masters commonly lack.",
        "chapters": [
          320
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_beast_phantom",
          "path_strength",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Its primeval cost is high. Containing one beast phantom needs five percent of snow silver primeval essence, so eight phantoms cost forty percent. Even at peak essence the eight phantom burst can be used only about twice in theory, and fewer times once movement, defense, and All-out Effort Gu also spend essence.",
        "chapters": [
          320
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_all_out_effort_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He first shows it against Ju Kai Bei on the Shang clan city battle stage. Eight solid beast phantoms attack together, Ju Kai Bei names the Gu, and then surrenders.",
        "chapters": [
          320
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Onlookers treat Strength Qi Gu as the piece that removes Fang Yuan’s long range weakness beside All-out Effort Gu, Bitter Strength Gu, and self-reliance Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          321
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_bitter_strength_gu",
          "gu_self_reliance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Xue San Si he again pours yellow gold primeval essence into Strength Qi Gu, attaches strength qi to eight beast phantoms, and sends them into the crater.",
        "chapters": [
          343
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_xue_san_si"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
